00:01:32.619 --> 00:01:35.899
First of all, walk 8000 steps a day.

00:01:35.899 --> 00:01:38.670
If you can make it 10,000 even better.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.450
You don't know how much you're walking.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.130
Most phones have a step tracker in them.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.860
I use a Fitbit that goes on my wrist.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:52.050
If you're walking 8000 steps a day every day,
that is already going to put you in terms

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:57.039
of mobility and avoiding sort of like a sedentary
situation.

00:01:57.039 --> 00:01:59.810
It's going to put you ahead of 80% of people.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:05.740
If I look down, if it's 6:00 or 7:00 and I
