00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.940
Number three, drink enough water.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:46.170
I find sometimes at 5:00 I am not feeling
well and I'll think, oh my goodness, is it

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.820
